---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How Mighty Little Bookshelf handles your information.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <p class="section-label">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 font-display text-3xl font-semibold sm:text-4xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-light">Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long' })}</p>

    <div class="card mt-8 space-y-6 p-6 sm:p-10">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-teal-700">Who we are</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-ink">
          {SITE.name} ({SITE.url}) is a book discovery resource for families. This policy explains what information
          we collect when you visit, and how it's used.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-teal-700">Information we collect</h2>
        <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-ink">
          <li><strong>Newsletter sign-up:</strong> if you subscribe, we collect the email address you provide.</li>
          <li><strong>Contact form:</strong> if you contact us, we collect the name, email, and message you provide.</li>
          <li>
            <strong>Usage analytics:</strong> we may use privacy-friendly, aggregate analytics (such as page views
            and referral source) to understand how the site is used. We do not sell this data.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-teal-700">Cookies</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-ink">
          This site itself does not set tracking cookies. If you click through to Amazon, Amazon may set its own
          cookies in accordance with its own privacy policy — we don't control or have access to that data.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-teal-700">Third-party links</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-ink">
          Book links on this site lead to Amazon.com. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of Amazon or
          any other third-party site we link to. We encourage you to review their privacy policies directly.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-teal-700">How we use your information</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-ink">
          We use the information you provide solely to respond to your message, send the newsletter you signed up
          for, and improve the site. We do not sell or rent your personal information to third parties.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-teal-700">Your choices</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-ink">
          You can unsubscribe from our newsletter at any time using the link in any email we send. To request that
          we delete information you've shared with us, <a href="/contact/" class="font-semibold text-teal-700 underline">contact us</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-teal-700">Children's privacy</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-ink">
          This site is intended for parents, caregivers, and clinicians. We do not knowingly collect personal
          information from children.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-teal-700">Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-ink">
          We may update this policy from time to time. The "last updated" date at the top of this page reflects the
          most recent revision.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-teal-700">Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-ink">
          Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class="font-semibold text-teal-700 underline">{SITE.email}</a>
          or via our <a href="/contact/" class="font-semibold text-teal-700 underline">contact page</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
